ModuleDocComment 0..91 "//! Blocks of x86-64 instructions (spec 07, section 6): operands are the table's registers,"
Whitespace 91..92 "\n"
ModuleDocComment 92..189 "//! integers, labels, memory and Vun values bound to registers; each call takes the first form of"
Whitespace 189..190 "\n"
ModuleDocComment 190..269 "//! its instruction that fits, and a block whose end is not reached is `never`."
